msgstr "Tetangga terdekat"

msgid "On"
msgstr "Aktif"

msgid "Off"
msgstr "Nonaktif"

msgid "TV"
msgstr "TV"

msgid "GamePad"
msgstr "GamePad"

msgid "Screens"
msgstr "Layar"

msgid "Stretched"
msgstr "Diregangkan"

msgid "Its shape"
msgstr "Bentuk aslinya"

msgid "The TV's and the GamePad's pictures, and how they fill the screen."
msgstr "Gambar TV dan GamePad, dan cara keduanya mengisi layar."

msgid "Main screen"
msgstr "Layar utama"

msgid "Which picture fills the TV: the TV's or the GamePad's. In the game, touchpad click + L1 swaps them."
msgstr "Gambar mana yang mengisi TV: gambar TV atau GamePad. Dalam game, klik panel sentuh + L1 menukarnya."

msgid "TV in a corner"
msgstr "TV di sudut"

msgid "GamePad in a corner"
msgstr "GamePad di sudut"

msgid "The other screen, small in the bottom right corner. In the game, touchpad click + R1."
msgstr "Layar lainnya, kecil di sudut kanan bawah. Dalam game: klik panel sentuh + R1."

msgid "Picture"
msgstr "Gambar"

msgid "Its own shape"
msgstr "Bentuk aslinya"

msgid "Its own shape keeps the picture's proportions, with bars where they differ from the screen's; Stretched fills it."
msgstr "Bentuk aslinya mempertahankan proporsi gambar, dengan bilah di bagian yang berbeda dari layar; Diregangkan mengisi layar."

msgid "Graphics"
msgstr "Grafis"

msgid "Upscaling, Cemu's accuracy settings and the performance overlay. Kept for the next games."
msgstr "Peningkatan skala, pengaturan akurasi Cemu, dan overlay performa. Tetap berlaku untuk game berikutnya."

msgid "Upscaling to 4K"
msgstr "Peningkatan skala ke 4K"

msgid "How the picture is scaled to the screen: Bicubic is sharp, Hermite softer, Bilinear softer still."
msgstr "Cara gambar diskalakan ke layar: Bikubik tajam, Hermite lebih lembut, Bilinear lebih lembut lagi."

msgid "Accurate barriers"
msgstr "Barrier akurat"

msgid "Off can raise the frame rate, but some games then flicker or show wrong shadows. It changes at once."
msgstr "Nonaktif bisa menaikkan frame rate, tetapi beberapa game lalu berkedip atau menampilkan bayangan yang salah. Langsung berlaku."

msgid "Async shader compile"
msgstr "Kompilasi shader asinkron"

msgid "On, new shaders build while the game carries on: no stutter, but things may be missing for a moment."
msgstr "Aktif: shader baru dibuat sementara game terus berjalan. Tanpa tersendat, tetapi sesuatu mungkin hilang sesaat."

msgid "Frame pacing"
msgstr "Ritme frame"

msgid "Holds the game to an even rate: 60 fps for 4K at 120 Hz, 30 for 8K at 60 Hz. Off shows each frame when it is done."
msgstr "Menjaga game di laju yang rata: 60 fps untuk 4K di 120 Hz, 30 untuk 8K di 60 Hz. Nonaktif menampilkan setiap frame begitu siap."

msgid "Performance overlay"
msgstr "Overlay performa"

msgid "Frames per second, CPU and memory use in the top left corner, as Cemu shows them."
msgstr "Frame per detik, penggunaan CPU dan memori di sudut kiri atas, seperti yang ditampilkan Cemu."

msgid "{0} (next start)"
msgstr "{0} (mulai berikutnya)"

msgid "This pack replaces textures: the game shows the change when it starts again."
msgstr "Paket ini mengganti tekstur: game menampilkan perubahannya saat dimulai lagi."

msgid "Cross turns it on or off; the game shows it at once."
msgstr "Silang mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkannya; game langsung menampilkannya."

msgid "Preset"
msgstr "Preset"

msgid "Left and Right choose another; the game shows it at once."
msgstr "Kiri dan Kanan memilih yang lain; game langsung menampilkannya."

msgid "None for this game"
msgstr "Tidak ada untuk game ini"

msgid "Reading the packs…"
msgstr "Membaca paket…"

msgid "The community graphic packs have none for this game."
msgstr "Paket grafis komunitas tidak punya satu pun untuk game ini."

msgid "Graphic packs"
msgstr "Paket grafis"

msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "{0} on"
msgid_plural "{0} on"
msgstr[0] "{0} aktif"

msgid "The game's community graphic packs: resolution, frame rate and mods, as Cemu's Graphic Packs window has them."
msgstr "Paket grafis komunitas untuk game ini: resolusi, frame rate, dan mod, seperti di jendela Graphic Packs Cemu."

msgid "The game sees the change when it starts again: the portal is plugged in as a game starts."
msgstr "Game melihat perubahannya saat dimulai lagi: portal disambungkan saat game dimulai."

msgid "Plugged in as a game starts, as in Cemu. Its figures are below while it is on."
msgstr "Disambungkan saat game dimulai, seperti di Cemu. Figurnya ada di bawah selama portal aktif."

msgid "Empty"
msgstr "Kosong"

msgid "Put figure dumps in {0} to put them on here."
msgstr "Taruh dump figur di {0} untuk menempatkannya di sini."

msgid "Left and Right put the next figure on it; Empty takes it off."
msgstr "Kiri dan Kanan menaruh figur berikutnya; Kosong mengangkatnya."

msgid "The last figure could not be put on."
msgstr "Figur terakhir tidak bisa ditaruh."

msgid "USB devices"
msgstr "Perangkat USB"

msgid "Skylanders, Disney Infinity and LEGO Dimensions figures on Cemu's emulated portals, as amiibo are scanned."
msgstr "Figur Skylanders, Disney Infinity, dan LEGO Dimensions di portal emulasi Cemu, seperti amiibo dipindai."

msgid "Volume"
msgstr "Volume"

msgid "The game's sound. Left and Right change it by 10%."
msgstr "Suara game. Kiri dan Kanan mengubahnya 10%."

msgid "Amiibo"
msgstr "amiibo"

msgid "Put amiibo dumps (.bin) in /data/ps5cemu/amiibo to scan them here."
msgstr "Taruh dump amiibo (.bin) di /data/ps5cemu/amiibo untuk memindainya di sini."

msgid "Left and Right choose an amiibo dump; Cross touches it to the GamePad when the game asks for one."
msgstr "Kiri dan Kanan memilih dump amiibo; Silang menempelkannya ke GamePad saat game memintanya."

msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Kontrol"

msgid "Each player's controller, motion, vibration, deadzones and A and B."
msgstr "Kontroler, gerakan, getaran, zona mati, serta A dan B tiap pemain."

msgid "Player"
msgstr "Pemain"

msgid "{0} (no DualSense)"
msgstr "{0} (tanpa DualSense)"

msgid "Whose controller the settings below are: Left and Right choose the player."
msgstr "Milik siapa kontroler untuk pengaturan di bawah: Kiri dan Kanan memilih pemain."

msgid "Emulated controller"
msgstr "Kontroler emulasi"

msgid "What the game sees in this player's hands. Most games want the GamePad for player 1."
msgstr "Apa yang dilihat game di tangan pemain ini. Sebagian besar game menginginkan GamePad untuk pemain 1."

msgid "Motion controls"
msgstr "Kontrol gerakan"

msgid "None on this one"
msgstr "Yang ini tidak punya"

msgid "The DualSense's gyroscope and accelerometer, for the games that aim or steer by tilting."
msgstr "Giroskop dan akselerometer DualSense, untuk game yang membidik atau mengemudi dengan memiringkan."

msgid "Vibration"
msgstr "Getaran"

msgid "How strongly the DualSense rumbles. Left and Right change it by 10%."
msgstr "Seberapa kuat DualSense bergetar. Kiri dan Kanan mengubahnya 10%."

msgid "Left stick deadzone"
msgstr "Zona mati stik kiri"

msgid "How far the left stick moves before the game sees it. Raise it if a character drifts."
msgstr "Seberapa jauh stik kiri bergerak sebelum game menyadarinya. Naikkan jika karakter berjalan sendiri."

msgid "Right stick deadzone"
msgstr "Zona mati stik kanan"

msgid "How far the right stick moves before the game sees it. Raise it if the camera drifts."
msgstr "Seberapa jauh stik kanan bergerak sebelum game menyadarinya. Naikkan jika kamera bergeser sendiri."

msgid "A and B"
msgstr "A dan B"

msgid "A on Circle"
msgstr "A di Lingkaran"

msgid "A on Cross"
msgstr "A di Silang"

msgid "A on Circle as on the Wii U, or on Cross, with X and Y swapped to match. Every button: the launcher's Settings > Wii U > Controllers."
msgstr "A di Lingkaran seperti di Wii U, atau di Silang, dengan X dan Y ditukar agar cocok. Semua tombol: Pengaturan > Wii U > Kontroler di peluncur."

msgid "Quit to the library"
msgstr "Keluar ke pustaka"

msgid "Leaves the game for the library. What you have not saved in the game is lost, so Cross is held."
msgstr "Meninggalkan game ke pustaka. Apa pun yang belum disimpan di game akan hilang, jadi Silang ditahan."

msgid "Resume"
msgstr "Lanjutkan"

msgid "GamePad main"
msgstr "GamePad besar"

msgid "TV main"
msgstr "TV besar"

msgid "Scan"
msgstr "Pindai"

msgid "Scanned {0}"
msgstr "{0} dipindai"

msgid "Not scanned (error {0})"
msgstr "Tidak dipindai (galat {0})"

msgid "Running"
msgstr "Berjalan"

msgid "Choose"
msgstr "Pilih"

msgid "Change"
msgstr "Ubah"

msgid "Back to the game"
msgstr "Kembali ke game"

msgid "Back"
msgstr "Kembali"

msgid "Top above bottom"
msgstr "Atas di atas bawah"

msgid "Top screen only"
msgstr "Hanya layar atas"

msgid "Large top screen"
msgstr "Layar atas besar"

msgid "Side by side"
msgstr "Berdampingan"

msgctxt "texture filter"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "Screens and border"
msgstr "Layar dan bingkai"

msgid "The screens' layout, which one is the main one, and the border."
msgstr "Tata letak layar, mana yang utama, dan bingkainya."

msgid "Layout"
msgstr "Tata letak"

msgid "How the two screens share the TV. In the game, touchpad click + R1 goes to the next."
msgstr "Cara kedua layar berbagi TV. Dalam game, klik panel sentuh + R1 beralih ke berikutnya."

msgid "Bottom"
msgstr "Bawah"

msgid "Top"
msgstr "Atas"

msgid "Which screen takes the top screen's place. In the game, touchpad click + L1 swaps them."
msgstr "Layar mana yang mengambil tempat layar atas. Dalam game, klik panel sentuh + L1 menukarnya."

msgid "Border"
msgstr "Bingkai"

msgid "Artwork around the screens, never over them. Also in the launcher's Settings > Screens and borders."
msgstr "Gambar di sekitar layar, tidak pernah di atasnya. Juga di Pengaturan > Layar dan bingkai pada peluncur."

msgid "Internal resolution, texture filter and the performance overlay."
msgstr "Resolusi internal, filter tekstur, dan overlay performa."

msgid "Internal resolution"
msgstr "Resolusi internal"

msgid "How large the 3D scenes are drawn before they are scaled to the TV. Higher is sharper and asks more of the GPU."
msgstr "Seberapa besar adegan 3D digambar sebelum diskalakan ke TV. Lebih tinggi lebih tajam dan lebih membebani GPU."

msgid "Texture filter"
msgstr "Filter tekstur"

msgid "Smooths textures as they are scaled up. The costliest setting here: if a game stutters, try None first."
msgstr "Menghaluskan tekstur saat diperbesar. Pengaturan paling berat di sini: jika game tersendat, coba Tidak ada dulu."

msgid "The frame rate and the emulation's speed, in the top left corner."
msgstr "Frame rate dan kecepatan emulasi, di sudut kiri atas."

msgid "Speed"
msgstr "Kecepatan"

msgid "Unlimited"
msgstr "Tanpa batas"

msgid "The emulated CPU's clock, and how fast the game may run."
msgstr "Clock CPU emulasi, dan seberapa cepat game boleh berjalan."

msgid "CPU clock"
msgstr "Clock CPU"

msgid "Below 100% can bring a slow game to full speed; above it smooths games that dropped frames on the 3DS."
msgstr "Di bawah 100% bisa membuat game lambat berjalan dengan kecepatan penuh; di atasnya menghaluskan game yang kehilangan frame di 3DS."

msgid "Speed limit"
msgstr "Batas kecepatan"

msgctxt "speed limit"
msgid "None"
msgstr "Tidak ada"

msgid "Above 100% hurries through slow scenes; None runs as fast as the PS5 can. For this game only."
msgstr "Di atas 100% mempercepat adegan lambat; Tidak ada berjalan secepat yang PS5 mampu. Hanya untuk game ini."

msgid "Save states"
msgstr "Status tersimpan"

msgid "Slot {0}"
msgstr "Slot {0}"

msgid "Five slots for this game: save exactly where you are, and come back to it."
msgstr "Lima slot untuk game ini: simpan tepat di posisimu, lalu kembali ke sana."

msgid "Slot"
msgstr "Slot"

msgid "(empty)"
msgstr "(kosong)"

msgid "Which of this game's five slots to save to or load from."
msgstr "Slot mana dari lima slot game ini yang dipakai untuk menyimpan atau memuat."

msgid "Save to this slot"
msgstr "Simpan ke slot ini"

msgid "Saves the game as it is now, replacing what the slot had. Newer app versions may not load it: keep saving in the game too."
msgstr "Menyimpan game apa adanya sekarang, mengganti isi slot. Versi aplikasi yang lebih baru mungkin tidak bisa memuatnya: tetap simpan juga di dalam game."

msgid "Cheats"
msgstr "Cheat"

msgid "The game's cheats, from azahar/cheats/<title ID>.txt (Gateway format)."
msgstr "Cheat game ini, dari azahar/cheats/<ID judul>.txt (format Gateway)."

msgid "Cross, Left or Right turns it on or off, at once; it is kept for next time."
msgstr "Silang, Kiri, atau Kanan langsung mengaktifkan atau menonaktifkannya; tetap tersimpan untuk lain kali."

msgid "No cheats for this game"
msgstr "Tidak ada cheat untuk game ini"

msgid "Put them in /data/ps5cemu/azahar/cheats/<title ID>.txt, then start the game again."
msgstr "Taruh di /data/ps5cemu/azahar/cheats/<ID judul>.txt, lalu mulai ulang game."

msgid "{0} of {1} on"
msgstr "{0} dari {1} aktif"

msgid "Hold an amiibo dump to the 3DS's reader when the game asks for one."
msgstr "Tempelkan dump amiibo ke pembaca 3DS saat game memintanya."

msgid "Left and Right choose an amiibo dump; Cross holds it to the reader."
msgstr "Kiri dan Kanan memilih dump amiibo; Silang menempelkannya ke pembaca."

msgid "Take the amiibo away"
msgstr "Angkat amiibo"

msgid "Takes the amiibo off the reader, as lifting it off would."
msgstr "Mengangkat amiibo dari pembaca, seolah kamu mengangkatnya."

msgid "Motion controls, the sticks' deadzone and where A and B are."
msgstr "Kontrol gerakan, zona mati stik, dan letak A dan B."

msgid "The DualSense's gyroscope and accelerometer as the 3DS's, for the games that aim or steer by tilting."
msgstr "Giroskop dan akselerometer DualSense sebagai milik 3DS, untuk game yang membidik atau mengemudi dengan memiringkan."

msgid "Stick deadzone"
msgstr "Zona mati stik"

msgid "How far a stick moves before the game sees it. Raise it if something drifts when you let go."
msgstr "Seberapa jauh stik bergerak sebelum game menyadarinya. Naikkan jika sesuatu bergeser saat kamu melepasnya."

msgid "A on Circle and B on Cross, where the 3DS has them, or the other way round, with X and Y swapped to match."
msgstr "A di Lingkaran dan B di Silang, seperti di 3DS, atau sebaliknya, dengan X dan Y ditukar agar cocok."

msgid "Load this slot"
