msgid "3DS address"
msgstr "Alamat 3DS"

msgid ""
"The address Artic Base shows on the 3DS's screen when it is ready.\n"
"Cross edits it: Left and Right choose a number, Up and Down change it by 1, L1 and R1 by 10, and Cross again keeps it.\n"
"The 3DS and the PS5 must be on the same network."
msgstr ""
"Alamat yang ditampilkan Artic Base di layar 3DS saat siap.\n"
"Silang mengeditnya: Kiri dan Kanan memilih angka, Atas dan Bawah mengubahnya 1, L1 dan R1 sebanyak 10, dan Silang lagi menyimpannya.\n"
"3DS dan PS5 harus berada di jaringan yang sama."

msgid "Connect and play"
msgstr "Sambungkan dan main"

msgid ""
"On the 3DS, start the Artic Base app (homebrew, from Azahar's team) and choose a game in it: the cartridge or an installed one. Then connect from here: the game plays on the PS5 from the 3DS, and its saves stay on the 3DS.\n"
"It is only as smooth as the network: a strong Wi-Fi signal for the 3DS and a wired PS5 help."
msgstr ""
"Di 3DS, jalankan aplikasi Artic Base (homebrew dari tim Azahar) dan pilih game di dalamnya: kartrid atau yang terpasang. Lalu sambungkan dari sini: game berjalan di PS5 dari 3DS, dan data simpanannya tetap di 3DS.\n"
"Kelancarannya tergantung jaringan: sinyal Wi-Fi yang kuat untuk 3DS dan PS5 yang memakai kabel akan membantu."

msgid "Set up from an Old 3DS"
msgstr "Siapkan dari Old 3DS"

msgid ""
"With the Artic Setup Tool app running on an Old 3DS or 2DS: copies its system files and its own data (system settings, friend code, Mii and eShop data) into Azahar, so games that need the 3DS's system applets or files start, and the Home Menu can (Settings > System and Home Menu).\n"
"That data is your console's: do not share Azahar's folder afterwards."
msgstr ""
"Dengan aplikasi Artic Setup Tool berjalan di 3DS atau 2DS lama: menyalin file sistem dan data miliknya (pengaturan sistem, kode teman, data Mii dan eShop) ke Azahar, agar game yang membutuhkan applet atau file sistem 3DS bisa dimulai, begitu juga Menu HOME (Pengaturan > Sistem dan Menu HOME).\n"
"Data itu milik konsolmu: jangan bagikan folder Azahar setelahnya."

msgid "Set up from a New 3DS"
msgstr "Siapkan dari New 3DS"

msgid "As above, from a New 3DS or New 2DS running the Artic Setup Tool app."
msgstr "Seperti di atas, dari New 3DS atau New 2DS yang menjalankan aplikasi Artic Setup Tool."

